node_modules/
dist/
build/
.turbo/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Anchored to the repo root: a bare `data/` matches ANY directory named data at any depth, and
# silently excluded all of apps/web/src/data/ — seven source files the app cannot build without.
/data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.db-*
.vite/
.nooklet-build/
test-results/
playwright-report/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/.cache/
apps/desktop/sidecar/
# NOT a build output: the desktop launcher page (`frontendDist` in tauri.conf.json) is hand-written
# source. `dist/` above swallowed it, so a clean checkout could not compile the desktop app at all
# ("frontendDist … doesn't exist") and the page existed only on one machine (B-530).
!apps/desktop/dist/
